{"seq":1,"slug":"warehouse-selection","title":"分仓选择与履约成本路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/carrier-routing/warehouse-selection","wordCount":2811,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分仓选择与履约成本路由\">分仓选择与履约成本路由</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「从最近的仓发货」是外行的直觉，也是许多履约系统的默认实现，但它在真实运营里经常给出错误答案。原因在于「最近」是一个物理距离，而成本、时效、可用性、关务资质都是与距离非线性相关、且彼此冲突的量。一个商品在上海仓、洛杉矶仓、法兰克福仓都有库存时，选择哪个仓发出，要同时满足：库存是否真的可承诺（不是账面有货而是可拣可用）、能否在承诺时效内送达、单件的履约总成本是否可控、该仓是否有对应目的国的关务资质与承运商合约。</p>\n<p>这构成一个<strong>带约束的选择问题</strong>，输入是履约单（商品、数量、收货地、承诺时效），输出是发货仓。它发生在拆单之后、选承运商之前：拆单已经按「单仓可满足性」做过一次粗分组，这里的任务是在<strong>多个都能满足的仓</strong>之间选。</p>\n<p>分仓选择与第二章其余两节的边界：<strong>选承运商</strong>在 <a href=\"carrier-abstraction\">多承运商接入抽象与比价</a>，那是在仓已定的前提下做运价与时效的比价；<strong>跨境段交接</strong>在 <a href=\"cross-border-handoff\">跨境头程→清关→尾程交接</a>。本文只回答「从哪个仓出」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;履约单&lt;br/&gt;商品/数量/收货地/承诺时效&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;候选仓集合&lt;br/&gt;库存可满足&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;硬约束过滤&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;无目的国关务资质&quot;| X1[&quot;剔除&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;产能已满/关仓&quot;| X2[&quot;剔除&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;不支持该品类&quot;| X3[&quot;剔除&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;可行仓集合&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;成本函数&lt;br/&gt;仓内作业 + 干线 + 关务&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;时效函数&lt;br/&gt;预计送达时间&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;加权评分&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{&quot;是否存在&lt;br/&gt;可用运力&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[&quot;回退到次优仓&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[&quot;选定发货仓&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;交给承运商比价&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"履约单&lt;br/&gt;商品/数量/收货地/承诺时效\"] --&gt; B[\"候选仓集合&lt;br/&gt;库存可满足\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"硬约束过滤\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"无目的国关务资质\"| X1[\"剔除\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"产能已满/关仓\"| X2[\"剔除\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"不支持该品类\"| X3[\"剔除\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"可行仓集合\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"成本函数&lt;br/&gt;仓内作业 + 干线 + 关务\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"时效函数&lt;br/&gt;预计送达时间\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"加权评分\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{\"是否存在&lt;br/&gt;可用运力\"}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[\"回退到次优仓\"]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[\"选定发货仓\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"交给承运商比价\"]</pre><p><code>C</code> 与 <code>H</code> 是两个容易被简化掉的环节。硬约束过滤（关务资质、品类能力、仓的当前状态）必须在评分之前，否则会选出一个评分最优但根本发不出去的仓；而 <code>H</code> 的存在是因为<strong>承运商运力是有限的</strong>：评分选出的仓可能在那一刻没有可用的提货排期，回退机制必须有。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标函数-履约成本的完整构成\">目标函数：履约成本的完整构成</h2><p>要选仓，先要能算「从仓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 发这批货到目的地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的成本」。成本和距离不是简单正比，把它拆成四项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>handling</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>lastmile</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(w, d, g) = C_{\\text{handling}}(w) + C_{\\text{linehaul}}(w, d) + C_{\\text{customs}}(w, g) + C_{\\text{lastmile}}(d_i, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastmile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是商品的合规属性（品类、申报价值、是否带电）。四项的性质差异很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>与距离关系</th>\n<th>主要影响因素</th>\n<th>优化抓手</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仓内作业 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>handling</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{handling}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无关</td>\n<td>仓的自动化程度、人力成本</td>\n<td>订单集中度、波次合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线/头程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{linehaul}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>弱相关（按通道而非公里）</td>\n<td>通道运力、体积重、燃油</td>\n<td>拼柜、通道选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{customs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无关</td>\n<td>目的国税率、清关方式、仓的资质</td>\n<td>保税仓 vs 直邮、批量清关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>lastmile</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{lastmile}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastmile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>强相关</td>\n<td>目的地密度、偏远程度、承运商</td>\n<td>就近仓、末端合单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的实用价值在于：<strong>它告诉你哪些项值得优化、哪些项其实是常数</strong>。仓内作业与关务成本基本上不随距离变化，所以「就近发货」实际上优化的只有尾程这一项——如果尾程占总成本比例不高（例如大批量、低价值的 B2B 订单，干线占比高），就近仓的收益就很有限，而它带来的库存分散代价（同一 SKU 在多仓各压一份库存）可能是净损失。</p>\n<p><strong>体积重</strong>是跨境里导致成本估算失真的头号因素。承运商按 <code>max(实重, 体积重)</code> 计费，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>volumetric</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{volumetric}} = \\frac{L \\times W \\times H}{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">volumetric</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是承运商的体积除数（常见取值 5000 或 6000，单位 cm³/kg；空运与快递不同、承运商之间不同）。轻抛货（抱枕、玩具、服装）的实际计费重量可能是实重的三到五倍。（DHL、FedEx、UPS 的国际快件服务通用 5000 cm³/kg，部分境内/邮政服务用 6000 或 7000；来源：Wikipedia, Dimensional weight, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight</a> ）选仓时如果只按实重估算，会系统性低估轻抛货的干线成本。工程上要求商品主数据提供<strong>包装后的体积</strong>，而不只是商品体积——包装尺寸是履约系统的必要输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效函数与承诺的可兑现性\">时效函数与承诺的可兑现性</h2><p>时效与成本是选仓的两个对抗目标。时效函数需要估算从仓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 到目的地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>送达时间分布</strong>，而不是一个点估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mtext>分布，需要 </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(w, d) \\sim \\text{分布，需要 } P(T(w,d) \\le T_{\\text{promise}}) \\ge 1 - \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分布，需要</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用分布而非点估计的意义在于：承诺时效是一个<strong>服务水平</strong>问题。同样预估 5 天的两个仓，一个方差很小（天天 5 天），一个方差很大（一半 3 天一半 8 天），对用户体验完全不同。分位数（如 P90）比均值更适合做承诺依据，因为用户对「超时」比「提前」敏感得多。时效预估模型的详细方法见 <a href=\"../tracking-eta/eta-prediction\">配送时效预估模型</a>，本文只把它当作选仓的一个输入函数。</p>\n<p>选仓时把成本与时效组合成单一评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>InventoryRisk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}(w) = C(w, d, g) + \\alpha \\cdot \\max\\!\\big(0,\\; q_{90}(T(w,d)) - T_{\\text{promise}}\\big) + \\beta \\cdot \\text{InventoryRisk}(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InventoryRisk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二项是超时惩罚（只在超过承诺时计入），第三项是库存风险——从某个仓发货意味着消耗那里的库存，若该仓的该 SKU 库存深度很浅，发掉之后其他订单可能需要跨仓调拨。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值是业务决策，但在跨境场景下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 通常显著大于国内，因为跨境时效违约的退款与投诉成本更高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存可满足性-账面库存与可承诺库存的区别\">库存可满足性：账面库存与可承诺库存的区别</h2><p>选仓的候选集合来自「哪些仓有货」，但这个「有货」必须是<strong>可承诺库存</strong>（available-to-promise, ATP），而不是账面库存。两者的差异在履约系统里必须被显式建模，否则会选出一个「看起来有货实际发不出」的仓：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库存口径</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见差异来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实物库存</td>\n<td>仓里实际存在的数量</td>\n<td>盘点误差、在途未入库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账面库存</td>\n<td>系统记录的数量</td>\n<td>已售未拣、已拣未发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可承诺库存</td>\n<td>扣除已占用与不可用后的可用量</td>\n<td>预留、质检冻结、批次过期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本单可满足量</td>\n<td>该仓能为这一单提供的数量</td>\n<td>批次分配、单品多货位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景还有一个独有的扣减项：<strong>已下单但尚未清关的数量</strong>。一件商品在保税仓「有货」，但它的清关状态是「待申报」，此时它不能被新订单承诺。这类状态必须在 ATP 计算里体现，而不是等到拣货时才发现。</p>\n<p>工程上推荐让 ATP 由库存系统提供，履约系统只消费、不自行推算。履约系统自己推算 ATP 会与库存系统产生第二套真相，两边不一致时无法仲裁。这也意味着选仓的可行性判断依赖一次跨系统的查询——它应该被限制在候选仓集合上（先按粗粒度筛出 2-4 个候选，再逐个查 ATP），而不是对所有仓全量查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓的产能与关务资质-被低估的硬约束\">仓的产能与关务资质：被低估的硬约束</h2><p><strong>产能约束</strong>。每个仓的日处理能力（拣货工位、打包打包台、出库月台）是有限的。当某个仓的当日订单量超过产能时，新订单排到次日，承诺时效就会违约。因此选仓的硬约束里应包含<strong>仓的剩余产能</strong>，并且要考虑订单是并发涌入的——这是一个分布式配额分配问题。简单做法是给每个仓设置一个当日配额，选仓时原子扣减；配额耗尽的仓退出候选集。这比「选完之后发现爆仓再改派」便宜得多。</p>\n<p><strong>关务资质</strong>。跨境仓的资质决定了它能发往哪些国家、能用什么清关方式（直邮、保税、一般贸易）、能否处理特定品类（有些仓无危险品资质）。这不是可以「评分降低一点」的软约束，而是<strong>二值硬约束</strong>：无资质就是发不出去。资质信息应该作为仓的属性维护，并在候选过滤阶段使用。</p>\n<p><strong>仓的状态</strong>。仓会因盘点、系统升级、疫情管控、节假日而暂时关闭或降速。这要求仓的可用状态是一个可动态更新的属性，且选仓服务必须能感知它——一个静态的仓列表配置会在这类事件中持续产生错误路由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分仓与库存布局的耦合\">分仓与库存布局的耦合</h2><p>选仓算法不是孤立的：它的长期效果由<strong>库存布局</strong>决定。如果只有一个仓有某个 SKU 的货，选仓算法没有选择权；如果每个仓都压一份，选择权很大但库存成本很高。这是一个跨期的联合优化问题，经典结论是<strong>平方根法则</strong>（square-root law）的推广：安全库存总量随仓数量大致按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长。直观地说，把库存分散到 4 个仓，同样的服务水平需要的总库存约为单仓的 2 倍。</p>\n<p>这个规律对履约系统设计的启示是：<strong>不要在没有成本话语权的情况下无限增加候选仓</strong>。选仓服务应该暴露「本单选择了第几优的仓、代价差多少」这类可观测数据，让供应链团队能判断是否需要调整布局。如果数据显示 90% 的订单都选同一个仓，说明其他仓的库存布局是浪费的；如果数据显示订单在多个仓之间反复切换，说明没有仓有足够的库存深度。</p>\n<p>库存布局的调整周期是周或月，而选仓的决策周期是毫秒——两者必须解耦，选仓算法应把库存布局当作给定条件而不是自己去改变它。见 <a href=\"../reverse-global/fulfillment-observability\">履约时效/妥投率监控</a> 中关于如何用「仓命中率」「选仓代价差」等指标反向指导布局的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>选仓是带约束的选择问题，发生在拆单之后、选承运商之前；输入是履约单，输出是发货仓。</li>\n<li>先做硬约束过滤（关务资质、品类能力、产能、仓状态），再在可行集上评分；承运商运力不足时需要回退到次优仓。</li>\n<li>成本拆成仓内作业、干线、关务、尾程四项；只有尾程强相关距离，体积重是跨境成本失真的头号因素，商品主数据必须提供包装后体积。</li>\n<li>时效用分位数（P90）而非均值参与承诺；评分 = 成本 + 超时惩罚 + 库存风险。</li>\n<li>候选集合必须基于可承诺库存（ATP）而非账面库存；跨境还要扣除未清关数量。</li>\n<li>仓的产能是分布式配额问题，关务资质是二值硬约束，仓状态必须动态可感知。</li>\n<li>分仓与库存布局耦合，遵循平方根法则；选仓服务应暴露「最优仓代价差」等数据反向指导布局。</li>\n<li>选完仓之后见 <a href=\"carrier-abstraction\">多承运商接入抽象与比价</a>，跨境的段交接见 <a href=\"cross-border-handoff\">跨境头程→清关→尾程交接</a>，时效预估细节见 <a href=\"../tracking-eta/eta-prediction\">配送时效预估模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分仓选择与履约成本路由","id":"分仓选择与履约成本路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"目标函数：履约成本的完整构成","id":"目标函数-履约成本的完整构成"},{"level":2,"text":"时效函数与承诺的可兑现性","id":"时效函数与承诺的可兑现性"},{"level":2,"text":"库存可满足性：账面库存与可承诺库存的区别","id":"库存可满足性-账面库存与可承诺库存的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"仓的产能与关务资质：被低估的硬约束","id":"仓的产能与关务资质-被低估的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"分仓与库存布局的耦合","id":"分仓与库存布局的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多包裹/拆包发货处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/fulfillment-order/multi-package"},"next":{"title":"多承运商接入抽象与比价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/carrier-routing/carrier-abstraction"}}